(:doc :symbol "asl/packages/asl-proc/tests/reducerTest.asl#" :text "Unit tests for ASL stream reducer, ANSI stripping, CR collapsing, windowing, and diagnostics extraction.")
(:doc :symbol "asl/packages/asl-proc/tests/rpcProcTest.asl#" :text "Verification suite for interactive process Batch RPC operations and protocol lifecycle.")
(:doc :symbol "asl/packages/asl-proc/tests/sessionTest.asl#" :text "Verification test suite for interactive process sessions and streaming stdin.")
(:doc :symbol "asl/packages/asl-proc/tests/shTest.asl#" :text "Verification suite for AgentScript process automation and piping (d-446d).")
(:doc :symbol "asl/packages/asl-proc/tests/shTest.asl#benchRunCmdMb" :text "Times sh/runCmd! itself, not exec! -- runCmd! additionally spools the receipt and runs detectBoundPort's stringLower over the combined output, which was the actual quadratic hot path (PROC-spoolQuadratic round 2): a mutant that regresses stringJoin or stringLower back to O(n^2) must blow this budget, not sit inside an untimed call. The err arm is asserted on, not swallowed, so a spawn/spool failure fails loud.")
(:doc :symbol "asl/packages/asl-proc/tests/shTest.asl#benchStringJoinChars" :text "Joins n one-char strings and times it directly: the root cause of PROC-spoolQuadratic round 2 was prelude stringJoin's own O(n^2) left fold, not anything process-specific. 200k one-char strings is well inside budgetMs with the O(n log n) pairwise-merge fix, and comfortably exceeds it under the old left-fold stringJoin (measured 865ms at 100k, growing quadratically).")
(:doc :symbol "asl/packages/asl-proc/tests/shTest.asl#testBoundPortHeadBannerDetected" :text "PROC-spoolQuadratic round 2d: a server prints its startup banner near the start of its output, not the end. A round-2c last-64KB tail window misses a banner on the first line once more than 64KB of later output follows it (or finds a later, different match and reports the wrong port); this fails on round 2c's e885091b. The head window must still detect it with the right port.")
(:doc :symbol "asl/packages/asl-proc/tests/spoolTest.asl#" :text "Falsifiable test suite for APM Two-Tier Spooling and Resource Guards.")
(:doc :symbol "asl/packages/asl-proc/tests/watchdogPortTest.asl#" :text "D81 acceptance gate fixture for Task 55609: Port Binding Guard & State Machine Resurrection Fix.")
